{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Brave New World"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Privacy Issue"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  necessity, duty, advice, or strong disapproval in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fingerprint"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bmark \u200bleft by the \u200bpattern of \u200bcurved \u200blines on the end of a \u200bfinger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Imagine I were  to visit Disneyland, where they might make an image of my fingerprint."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about privacy issues."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to save from "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to spare someone from an unpleasant experience "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They might make an image of my fingerprint to save me from waiting in line."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "novel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "new and original "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They might make an image of my fingerprint to save me from waiting in line. Novel, right?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "identifiable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be recognized"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Suppose I were to give up  identifiable personal information everywhere."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "retrievable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "easily recovered"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would rather they not be retrievable. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "over-documented"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "recorded too often"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: However, even if they were to start changing storage policies, it's too late for us, the over-documented."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nameless"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "name is not publicly known"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have been captured, a nameless but present entity."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "face recognition software"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "software which can identify a specific individual in a digital image by analyzing and comparing patterns"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hopefully face recognition software will not have been scouring net images for someone resembling me. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to scour "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to search very carefully"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hopefully face recognition software will not have been scouring net images for someone resembling me. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "data chip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "\u200bsmall \u200bpiece of \u200belectronic \u200bequipment with information stored on it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How many stores will have been tracking me by data chip when I purchase?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le16ob07aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Future Perfect: Simple and Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> Future Perfect</span> tense to talk about an event that will have happened before another one in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/><span class=\"italic\">will have </span>+ past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">By 9 a.m. the elevator camera in my building will have caught me going out. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With the Future Perfect Continuous, an action in the future is unfinished by the time another action in the future starts. It is most often used with an expression of time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/>subject + <span class=\"italic\">will have been</span> + present participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">By 9 p.m., how many stores will have been tracking me by data chip when I purchase? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " If you think they won't have followed me through the station and subway cars as well, you'd be wrong.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will have been captured, a nameless but present entity.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How often will I have been asked for information online? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "These photos will have been uploaded to Instagram or Twitter or Facebook where hopefully face recognition software will not have been scouring net images for someone resembling me. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Electric eyes will have been watching on the street and in the streetcar.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Were and the Unreal Conditional ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">were</span> and the Unreal Conditional to talk about imaginary situations or events that are unlikely to occur.<br/>You use <span class=\"italic\">were</span> with the Unreal Conditional to express wishes, regrets or preferences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Unreal Conditional to talk about a hypothetical or unlikely situation. When you want to be more formal you can use <span class=\"italic\">were</span> + subject + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> -infinitive ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Were they to change storage policies, it would still be too late for us.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other uses of <span class=\"italic\">were </span>and the Unreal Conditional are to express wishes, regrets or preferences:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>after <span class=\"italic\">wish</span></li></ul>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I wish I weren't so paranoid, but I am.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>after <span class=\"italic\">if only</span></li></ul>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If only technology were less invasive.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>after <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span>/<span class=\"italic\">sooner</span></li></ul>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I'd rather the pictures were not retrievable.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine I were  to visit Disneyland, where they might make an image of my fingerprint to save me from waiting in line. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If only technology were less invasive. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Suppose I were to give up  identifiable personal information everywhere ... oh, wait, I do. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Everyone acts as if this were normal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We pass on information about ourselves as if it were nothing. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online, to the library or a DVD rental shop and get a copy of <span class=\"italic\">Identity Thief</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch the film and find out how someone's identity was stolen and how it was used.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a scene in the film that you like and write a summary of it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Outline your favorite scene to a partner or group explaining why you thought it was interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Finally discuss together whether or not you think this could happen and why.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I watch <span class=\"italic\">Identity Thief</span> in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I choose a scene and write a summary of it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I outline my favorite scene explaining why I thought it was interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss  together whether I think this could happen and why with my group.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le16ob07re1img01.jpg"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome"}, {"id": 1, "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"id": 0, "image": "engenn10le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"id": 1, "image": "engenn10le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "text": "Imagine if I were to visit Disneyland, where they might make an image of my fingerprint to save me from waiting in line. Novel, right? If only technology were less invasive. Suppose I were to give up  identifiable personal information everywhere ... oh, wait, I do. Everyone acts as if this were normal. We pass on information about ourselves as if it were nothing.\n<br>\nWe offer up  credit card and phone numbers, addresses, and zip codes. We tap in preferences, birth dates and answer questions. We post pictures and fill address books online. I'd sooner not have to participate in this, but sometimes I have to."}, {"id": 2, "image": "engenn10le16ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "43500", "text": "I would prefer to shop online where credit card numbers aren't stored. I would rather they not be retrievable. However, if they were to start changing storage policies, it's too late for us, the over-documented. I wish I wasn't so paranoid, but I am!\n<br>\nWhere will you have been  documented by the end of your day? By 9 a.m. the elevator camera in my building will have caught me going out. Electric eyes will have been watching on the street and in the streetcar. If you think they won't have followed me through the station and subway cars as well, you'd be wrong."}, {"id": 3, "image": "engenn10le16ob07re2img03.jpg", "time": "80500", "text": "By 4 p.m., someone I passed will have been taking pictures. I will have been captured, a nameless but present entity. These photos will have been uploaded to Instagram or Twitter or Facebook where hopefully face recognition software will not have been scouring net images for someone resembling me.\n<br>\nBy 9 p.m., how many stores will have been tracking me by data chip when I purchase? How often will I have been asked for information online? That depends on the day. <br/>I long to be less visible. What about you?"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le16ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": ""}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content"